#
# A valid list of several long privilege names is still accepted.
#
# restart
FOUND /in use with dynamic privileges 'SYSTEM_USER,PRIVILEGE_ALPHA,PRIVILEGE_BRAVO,PRIVILEGE_CHARLIE,PRIVILEGE_DELTA,PRIVILEGE_ECHO'\./ in utility_user_dyn_priv.err
#
# The same list with a trailing comma is rejected, and the server neither
# aborts nor stalls doing it.
#
# restart
FOUND /Wrong format of --utility-user-dynamic-privileges parameter value: SYSTEM_USER,PRIVILEGE_ALPHA,PRIVILEGE_BRAVO,PRIVILEGE_CHARLIE,PRIVILEGE_DELTA,PRIVILEGE_ECHO,/ in utility_user_dyn_priv.err
# restart
